1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,246
When you deposit one

2
00:00:01,246 --> 00:00:02,493
thousand dollars in a

3
00:00:02,493 --> 00:00:03,739
bank, the bank doesn't

4
00:00:03,739 --> 00:00:04,985
just hold onto it.

5
00:00:04,985 --> 00:00:06,444
Most of it gets

6
00:00:06,444 --> 00:00:07,903
lent back out, to

7
00:00:07,903 --> 00:00:08,997
other customers, as

8
00:00:08,997 --> 00:00:09,362
mortgages,

9
00:00:09,362 --> 00:00:10,821
car loans, and business

10
00:00:10,821 --> 00:00:11,186
credit.

11
00:00:11,186 --> 00:00:12,461
That's the fractional

12
00:00:12,461 --> 00:00:12,886
reserve

13
00:00:12,886 --> 00:00:14,586
system. Banks are required

14
00:00:14,586 --> 00:00:16,286
to keep only a

15
00:00:16,286 --> 00:00:17,986
portion of deposits readily

16
00:00:17,986 --> 00:00:18,411
