23
00:00:25,231 --> 00:00:26,756
Repeated across the whole

24
00:00:26,756 --> 00:00:28,281
banking system, that cycle

25
00:00:28,281 --> 00:00:29,806
is how most of

26
00:00:29,806 --> 00:00:31,331
the money supply actually

27
00:00:31,331 --> 00:00:32,094
gets created.

28
00:00:32,094 --> 00:00:33,454
It's not a scandal,

29
00:00:33,454 --> 00:00:34,814
it's the design. Your

30
00:00:34,814 --> 00:00:36,175
deposit is doing more

31
00:00:36,175 --> 00:00:37,535
work than just sitting

32
00:00:37,535 --> 00:00:38,895
in an account. Follow

33
